{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51860","headline":"题仙人洞石钟 · 无名氏","name":"题仙人洞石钟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我欲扣石钟，惊起洞中人。\n烟萝杳无际，空锁石门春。\n石洞何窈窕，云是仙人庭。\n仙人渺何许？瑶草空自青。\n石洞窅且深，花落无人扫。\n仙翁去不还，何处寻瑶草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}